                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir:</hi> I have been arrested at Poviat
                    Linchitsé, Miasta Zigerger, Gubernia, Warsaw. Please write to the State
                    Department at Washington for my release.</p>
                <p>Yours respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>BENJAMIN GOLDBERG.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">George W. Cook,</hi> Esq.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
